    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said, “Mortal man, speak to the mountains of Israel and tell them to listen to the message which I, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the Sovereign ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", have for them: Israel's enemies gloated and said, ‘Now those ancient hills are ours!’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Prophesy, then, and announce what I, the Sovereign ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", am saying. When the neighbouring nations captured and plundered the mountains of Israel, all of them insulted Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So now listen to what I, the Sovereign ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", say to you mountains and hills, to you brooks and valleys, to you places that were left in ruins, and to you deserted cities which were plundered and mocked by all the surrounding nations.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“I, the Sovereign ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", have spoken out in the heat of my anger against the surrounding nations, and especially against Edom. With glee and contempt, they captured my land and took possession of its pastures.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“So prophesy to the land of Israel; tell the mountains, hills, brooks, and valleys what I, the Sovereign ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", am saying in jealous anger because of the way the nations have insulted and humiliated them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I, the Sovereign ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", solemnly promise that the surrounding nations will be humiliated. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But on the mountains of Israel the trees will again grow leaves and bear fruit for you, my people Israel. You are going to come home soon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I am on your side, and I will make sure that your land is ploughed again and that seeds are sown there. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will make your population grow. You will live in the cities and rebuild everything that was left in ruins. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will make people and cattle increase in number. There will be more of you than ever before, and you will have many children. I will let you live there as you used to live, and I will make you more prosperous than ever. Then you will know that I am the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will bring you, my people Israel, back to live again in the land. It will be your own land, and it will never again let your children starve.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“I, the Sovereign ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", say: it is true that people say that the land eats people, and that it robs the nation of its children. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But from now on it will no longer eat people and rob you of your children. I, the Sovereign ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", have spoken. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The land will no longer have to listen to the nations mocking it or see the peoples sneer at it. The land will no longer rob the nation of its children. I, the Sovereign ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", have spoken.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " spoke to me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mortal man,” he said, “when the Israelites were living in their land, they defiled it by the way they lived and acted. I regarded their behaviour as being as ritually unclean as a woman is during her monthly period.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36.17",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "ritually unclean",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "…",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "period",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": ": This is based on the view of ritual uncleanness described in the Law of Moses (see Lev 15.19).",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I let them feel the force of my anger because of the murders they had committed in the land and because of the idols by which they had defiled it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I condemned them for the way they lived and acted, and I scattered them through foreign countries. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wherever they went, they brought disgrace on my holy name, because people would say, ‘These are the people of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", but they had to leave his land.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "That made me concerned for my holy name, since the Israelites brought disgrace on it everywhere they went.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Now then, give the Israelites the message that I, the Sovereign ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", have for them: what I am going to do is not for the sake of you Israelites, but for the sake of my holy name, which you have disgraced in every country where you have gone. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When I demonstrate to the nations the holiness of my great name — the name you disgraced among them — then they will know that I am the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". I, the Sovereign ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", have spoken. I will use you to show the nations that I am holy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will take you from every nation and country and bring you back to your own land. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will sprinkle clean water on you and make you clean from all your idols and everything else that has defiled you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.11.19+EZK.11.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezek 11.19–20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will give you a new heart and a new mind. I will take away your stubborn heart of stone and give you an obedient heart. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will put my spirit in you and I will see to it that you follow my laws and keep all the commands I have given you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then you will live in the land I gave your ancestors. You will be my people, and I will be your God. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will save you from everything that defiles you. I will command the corn to be plentiful, so that you will not have any more famines. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will increase the yield of your fruit trees and your fields, so that there will be no more famines to disgrace you among the nations. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You will remember your evil conduct and the wrongs that you committed, and you will be disgusted with yourselves because of your sins and your iniquities. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Israel, I want you to know that I am not doing all this for your sake. I want you to feel the shame and disgrace of what you are doing. I, the Sovereign ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", have spoken.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The Sovereign ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " says, “When I make you clean from all your sins, I will let you live in your cities again and let you rebuild the ruins. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Everyone who used to walk by your fields saw how overgrown and wild they were, but I will let you farm them again. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Everyone will say how this land, which was once a wilderness, has become like the Garden of Eden, and how the cities which were torn down, looted, and left in ruins, are now inhabited and fortified. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the neighbouring nations that have survived will know that I, the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", rebuild ruined cities and replant waste fields. I, the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", have promised that I would do this — and I will.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The Sovereign ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " says, “I will once again let the Israelites ask me for help, and I will let them increase in numbers like a flock of sheep. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The cities that are now in ruins will then be as full of people as Jerusalem was once full of the sheep which were offered as sacrifices at a festival. Then they will know that I am the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ".”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
